    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "These stunning 5-bedroom Alder homes blend charming exterior details with an elegant interior that continues the moment you step inside. \r\n\r\nBoasting a spacious 185 sq. m / 1,995 sq. ft of living space, these A2-rated homes combine modern design with superior energy efficiency, ideal for today’s family lifestyle. The ground floor’s impressive 2.7m ceiling height amplifies the sense of space.\r\n\r\nEvery detail in these homes is carefully considered, from the premium finishes to the practical features, like an EV charger installed.\r\n\r\nStonehaven offers more than just beautiful homes; it’s a vibrant, family-friendly community. The development will feature a Multi-Use Games Area, a playground, a dog walking area and a Neighbourhood Centre with a creche and grocery store, adding convenience and enhancing the lifestyle experience.\r\n\r\nAt Stonehaven, you’ll experience refined living with exceptional comfort. These homes are designed to maximise light and space, with thoughtful layouts and energy-efficient features that promote sustainable, cost-effective living.\r\n\r\nFor more information, visit stonehavennaas.com."
      },
